    // `[HOVER_CAPABLE_QUERY]` key (unchanged by this fix) — but `carousel` still has no
    // `[HOVER_CAPABLE_QUERY]` key AT ALL at this recipe level (the hover-capable override now
    // lives on the organism instead). Regression guard: if a `[HOVER_CAPABLE_QUERY]` key ever
    // reappears here with an unconditional `display: 'flex'`, the permanent-visibility bug
    // (Fix J's own original motivation) is back.
